# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto

# Source code — force LF
#
# 2026-08-07：`*.sh` 原本不在這份清單裡，而它是**唯一會因 CRLF 直接死掉**的類型
# —— bash 讀到 `\r` 會報 `$'\r': command not found`，再到函式定義就 syntax error。
# 後果：`run_fitness_daily.sh` / `run_fitness_weekly.sh` 被 build 進容器後
# **在排程情境完全無法執行**（fitness_daily 每日 rc=2、fitness_weekly 連 9 週 RED），
# 而我在 host（Git Bash 容忍 CRLF）跑同一支永遠是全綠 —— 典型「手動跑得動 ≠ 排程跑得動」。
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.jsx text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf

# Windows scripts — keep CRLF
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Binary files — no diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xls binary
*.pdf binary
